-- id: exp6803-sota-operational-handoff-corpus
-  title: Three-model operational-handoff proposal corpus
-  track: verification
-  priority: critical
-  agent_type: claude
-  model: opus
-  requires_gpu: true
-  max_turns: 100
-  estimated_wall_time_min: 480
-  per_unit_rows: true
-  milestone: 2026.08.594
-  deliverable: results/experiment_6803_sota_operational_handoff_corpus.json
-  gated_on:
-    - upstream: exp6802-operational-obligation-automaton-v2
-      artifact_field: operational_automaton_fixture_ready
-      op: '=='
-      value: true
-  prompt: |
-    CONTEXT:
-    Exp6802 supplies a typed operational contract. This task measures whether real local models
-    preserve that contract when an action request is handed off directly or compressed into prose.
-    The comparison follows arXiv:2608.24569, but it uses Carnot's exact action schema and the mandated
-    local GGUF models. This is an authentic proposal corpus. It is not a live ARC solve.
-
-    Work at {project_root}. The execution date is {date}.
-
-    EXISTING CODE TO READ FIRST:
-    - {project_root}/CLAUDE.md and {project_root}/CODEX.md
-    - {project_root}/scripts/experiment_template.py, cached_sota_pair() and GGUF notes
-    - {project_root}/results/experiment_6802_operational_obligation_automaton_v2.json
-    - {project_root}/python/carnot/agentic/arc_trajectory_supervisor.py
-    - {project_root}/python/carnot/llm/llama_cpp_backend.py
-    - {project_root}/scripts/llama_server_manager.py
-    - {project_root}/scripts/check_dual_gpu.py
-    - {project_root}/results/experiment_6745_sota_dual_encoding_proposal_corpus.json
-    - {project_root}/openspec/capabilities/agentic-verification/spec.md
-
-    TASK:
-    Generate a complete paired corpus of structured action proposals under direct typed and
-    length-matched prose-compressed handoffs. Invoke every mandated GGUF family with local llama.cpp
-    CUDA. Freeze all bytes and exact checks. No provider API, legacy headline model, game source,
-    offline BFS, or hand-built per-game adapter is allowed.
-
-    CONCRETE STEPS:
-    0. PRECONDITIONS: require operational_automaton_fixture_ready=true, local model files, hashes,
-       llama.cpp health, disk space, and task-owned GPU leases. Define MODEL_SPECS exactly as
-       unsloth/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-GGUF, unsloth/gemma-4-31B-it-GGUF, and
-       unsloth/gemma-4-26B-A4B-it-GGUF. Never pass a GGUF repository to AutoTokenizer. If a bounded
-       lease or full model load fails, write complete_blocked_sota_operational_handoff_corpus with
-       gate_check_summary and stop. Do not substitute a smaller model.
-    1. Freeze at least 48 source-free operational scenarios across stale prerequisites, competing
-       authorities, required fallback, consequence retention, and soft target conflict. Freeze
-       direct and length-matched compression prompts before inference.
-    2. Run all three models in sequential task-owned phases. Use identical scenario, seed, token,
-       candidate, stop, and retry budgets in both handoff arms. Save raw prompt and output bytes,
-       hashes, first-token evidence, runtime receipts, offload, VRAM, and teardown per phase.
-    3. Parse proposals without repair. Apply the Exp6802 exact contract after generation. Record all
-       four operational fields, hard and binding preservation, parse completion, candidate diversity,
-       legal proposal support, and retries. The exact checker evaluates; it never becomes a prompt
-       feature.
-    4. Use parent-owned atomic checkpoints per model-scenario-arm cell. Resume only byte-identical
-       manifests. Never pool a missing phase into a headline.
-    5. Emit one row per model-scenario-seed-arm-candidate. Derive all direct-versus-compression
-       effects and intervals from rows. Set operational_handoff_corpus_ready from complete rows,
-       exact checks, raw bytes, and teardown, independent of effect sign. This exact field is
-       consumed by Exp6804.
-    6. Run focused tests, ruff, spec coverage, CUDA E2E checks, adversarial verification, artifact
-       convention audit, and verdict-row consistency lint.
-    7. REQUIRED ARTIFACT FIELDS: field_principles; inference_substrate (local llama.cpp CUDA GGUF);
-       duration_s; random_seed; reproducibility_checksum; model_specs (exact hub IDs, GGUF paths,
-       file hashes, roles, chat templates, tokenizers, limits); models_used; live_model_invoked;
-       frozen_manifest; gpu_receipts; checkpoint_receipts; raw_output_manifest; rows (every paired
-       unit); operational_preservation_by_arm; hard_violation_rate_by_arm;
-       binding_preservation_by_arm; parse_completion_by_arm; legal_support_by_arm;
-       retry_demand_by_arm; paired_handoff_deltas; operational_handoff_corpus_ready (exact
-       downstream field); solve_claim (false); solve_provenance (development_proxy); source_receipts;
-       gate_check_summary; verifier_is_oracle (false); verdict_class (closed enum: positive |
-       circular_positive | null | blocked | disqualified | partial); and honest_verdict.
-
-    Run command: cd {project_root} && .venv/bin/python scripts/experiments/experiment_6803_sota_operational_handoff_corpus.py --date {date}
-    Do NOT push. Do NOT modify scripts/research_conductor.py.
